		d: ['M5.5 7 H18.5 A2 2 0 0 1 20.5 9 V15 A2 2 0 0 1 18.5 17 H5.5 A2 2 0 0 1 3.5 15 V9 A2 2 0 0 1 5.5 7 Z', 'M8 14 H16', 'M7 10.6 H7.01', 'M10.4 10.6 H10.41', 'M13.8 10.6 H13.81'],
